{"step_index":1849,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:48Z","thinking":"Revenue information is not available in the Bizno platform, even for corporate entities. Investigating alternative sources, starting with Saramin, which appears to link to NICE evaluation data and showed revenue for a specific company. Other potential sources include Jobkorea, Catch, NICE Bizline, KED, 혁신의숲, The VC, and the DART API/website.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test searching Saramin by business registration number\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const https = require('https');\\n\\nfunction searchSaramin(query) {\\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\\n    const url = `https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/search/company?searchword=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`;\\n    https.get(url, {\\n      headers: {\\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\\n        'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml',\\n        'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9'\\n      }\\n    }, res => {\\n      let d = '';\\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(d));\\n    }).on('error', reject);\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nasync function test() {\\n  console.log('Testing bizno query: 186-86-00972');\\n  const d1 = await searchSaramin('186-86-00972');\\n  console.log('Result 1 length:', d1.length, 'includes 브이드림:', d1.includes('브이드림'));\\n\\n  console.log('\\\\nTesting bizno query without hyphen: 1868600972');\\n  const d2 = await searchSaramin('1868600972');\\n  console.log('Result 2 length:', d2.length, 'includes 브이드림:', d2.includes('브이드림'));\\n}\\n\\ntest();\\n\"","Description":"\"Test Saramin search by bizno\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/test_saramin_bizno.j