{"step_index":1861,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:14Z","thinking":"The provided snippet clearly states \"192만원 매출액 (= 1,920,000원!)\", confirming the revenue figure. This figure originates directly from the NICE평가정보 data source, as explicitly indicated. The Saramin company page also confirms this figure, displaying \"192만원\" in its summary.\n\n\nAutomating revenue extraction requires a systematic approach across multiple data sources like Saramin, DART, and Jobkorea, targeting 192 companies. The process involves iteratively querying company names, cleaning the names, and validating matches based on CEO, address, and establishment year against search results. Successful matches will be followed by revenue parsing from specific HTML elements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test script to search first 20 verified companies on Saramin for revenue\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\nconst path = require('path');\\nconst https = require('https');\\n\\nconst SCRATCH = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch';\\nconst masterList = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(SCRATCH, 'master_verified_194.json'), 'utf8'));\\n\\nfunction fetchUrl(url) {\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\\n    const req = https.get(url, {\\n      headers: {\\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\\n        'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml',\\n        'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9',\\n        'Referer': 'https://www.saramin.co.kr/'\\n      }\\n    }, res => {\\n      let data = '';\\n      res.on('data', chunk => data += chunk);\\n      res.on('end', () => resolve({ status: res.statusCode, data }));\\n    });\\n    req.on('error', err => resolve({ status: 500, error: err.message }));\\n    req.setTimeout(8000, () => {\\n      req.destroy();\\n      resolve({ status: 408, error: 'timeout' });\\n    });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction parseRevenue(text) {\\n  if (!text) return null;\\n  text = text.trim();\\n  // e.g. \\\"60억 181만원\\\", \\\"192만원\\\", \\\"15억\\\", \\\"3,500만원\\\"\\n  let totalWon = 0;\\n  const eokMatch = text.match(/([\\\\d,.]+)\\\\s*억/);\\n  const manMatch = text.match(/([\\\\d,.]+)\\\\s*만\\\\s*원?/);\\n  const wonMatch = text.match(/([\\\\d,]+)\\\\s*원/);\\n\\n  if (eokMatch) {\\n    const eokVal = parseFloat(eokMatch[1].replace(/,/g, ''));\\n    totalWon += eokVal * 100000000;\\n  }\\n  if (manMatch) {\\n    const manVal = parseFloat(manMatch[1].replace(/,/g, ''));\\n    totalWon += manVal * 10000;\\n  }\\n  if (!eokMatch && !manMatch && wonMatch) {\\n    totalWon += parseInt(wonMatch[1].replace(/,/g, ''), 10);\\n  }\\n\\n  if (totalWon > 0) {\\n    return {\\n      rawText: text,\\n      won: totalWon,\\n      formattedWon: totalWon.toLocaleString('ko-KR')\\n    };\\n  }\\n  return { rawText: text, won: null, formattedWon: text };\\n}\\n\\nasync function searchCompany(item) {\\n  // Search\n<truncated 4132 bytes>","Description":"\"Batch test Saramin search for first 25 verified companies\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/batch_test_saramin.js\"","toolAction":"\"Testing Saramin batch search\"","toolSummary":"\"Test Saramin batch search\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
